  {
    "type": 0,
    "content": "Discoveries have nothing to do with the last object you break on a certain depth. Discoveries are found by breaking the final object that can appear in a given tunnel. In pebblecove only stonespires will give you a Grand Discovery, does not matter if it is the first or last, as long as you break them you have a chance of finding it.",
